  {
   "kind": "defaults_inconsistency",
   "text": "the family defaults store faceWallTier1Width as 1.360 and faceWallBaseWidth as 1.760 (metres-scale numbers) while the rule engine treats both as millimetres and falls back to 1360 / 1760 only when the field is absent: because 1.36 and 1.76 are truthy, the stored defaults are used AS mm, making the defaulted face wall tiers about 1000x too narrow.",
   "evidence": [
